From: Thomas Bourgoin <thomas.bourgoin@foss.st.com>
Date: Mon, 13 Apr 2026 15:48:08 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 296/913] dts: stm32: configure etzpc controller for CRYP1 node

Set access-controllers property for cryp1 node in stm32mp15xf.dtsi

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/optee_os.git 3d13134c0a0d518961d719af2a314a96feee05d2 dts: stm32: configure etzpc controller for CRYP1 node]
Change-Id: I1379f565c6ad610248e76d79ecbda7b1aa9c2fed
Signed-off-by: Thomas Bourgoin <thomas.bourgoin@foss.st.com>
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/optee/optee_os/+/557093
ACI: CITOOLS <MDG-smet-aci-reviews@list.st.com>
Domain-Review: Yann GAUTIER <yann.gautier@foss.st.com>
---
 core/arch/arm/dts/stm32mp15xf.dtsi | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/core/arch/arm/dts/stm32mp15xf.dtsi b/core/arch/arm/dts/stm32mp15xf.dtsi
index 120dde032..907593373 100644
--- a/core/arch/arm/dts/stm32mp15xf.dtsi
+++ b/core/arch/arm/dts/stm32mp15xf.dtsi
@@ -13,6 +13,7 @@
 		interrupts = <GIC_SPI 79 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_HIGH>;
 		clocks = <&rcc CRYP1>;
 		resets = <&rcc CRYP1_R>;
+		access-controllers = <&etzpc STM32MP1_ETZPC_CRYP1_ID>;
 		status = "disabled";
 	};
 };
